WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.291 --> 00:00:02.210
- This has been an exciting thing for me,

00:00:02.210 --> 00:00:04.570
to start a new show, so I'm super excited.

00:00:04.570 --> 00:00:06.120
I'm wearing my onesie.

00:00:06.120 --> 00:00:07.190
(knocking at door)
(crowd applauding)

00:00:07.190 --> 00:00:08.140
It's like, it feels like a--

00:00:08.140 --> 00:00:09.220
- Kelly?

00:00:09.220 --> 00:00:10.053
Kelly?

00:00:10.053 --> 00:00:11.309
- Oh, hey, what's up, Ellen?

00:00:11.309 --> 00:00:14.059
(crowd cheering)

00:00:15.307 --> 00:00:16.140
What?

00:00:17.811 --> 00:00:18.644
You guys!

00:00:19.840 --> 00:00:20.757
What's up?!

00:00:26.605 --> 00:00:27.663
What're you doing here?

00:00:27.663 --> 00:00:30.246
- Thank you, thank you so much.

00:00:31.223 --> 00:00:32.530
I just wanted to say,

00:00:32.530 --> 00:00:35.620
I knew you were starting
today and I was just, not,

00:00:35.620 --> 00:00:36.570
I wasn't in the neighborhood.

00:00:36.570 --> 00:00:39.143
I came here just to say
congratulations, good luck,

00:00:39.143 --> 00:00:41.586
and I want you to have
a really great show.

00:00:41.586 --> 00:00:43.658
(applauding)

00:00:43.658 --> 00:00:45.241
- Thank you, Ellen!

00:00:47.018 --> 00:00:49.125
That was so nice!

00:00:49.125 --> 00:00:51.792
(crowd cheering)

00:00:51.792 --> 00:00:52.625
What?

00:00:54.833 --> 00:00:56.500
Ellen, what's wrong?

00:00:57.517 --> 00:00:58.463
- I'm sorry.
- What's wrong?

00:00:58.463 --> 00:01:01.296
(crowd cheering)

00:01:04.154 --> 00:01:05.763
- I'm so sorry.

00:01:05.763 --> 00:01:07.013
- What's wrong?

00:01:12.214 --> 00:01:13.320
I'm so honored!

00:01:13.320 --> 00:01:14.250
- Is that a chair?

00:01:14.250 --> 00:01:15.617
- Yes, it is now.

00:01:15.617 --> 00:01:17.141
(laughing)

00:01:17.141 --> 00:01:19.350
- I was looking for the exit
and they said it was that way

00:01:19.350 --> 00:01:22.240
and I'm so, I'm interrupting
your show and I'm so sorry.

00:01:22.240 --> 00:01:24.120
- No, wait, you're here, they love you,

00:01:24.120 --> 00:01:25.490
I love you, just stay a little!

00:01:25.490 --> 00:01:28.337
(crowd cheering)

00:01:28.337 --> 00:01:29.870
Just stay a little longer!

00:01:29.870 --> 00:01:31.680
- Actually, I'm so glad you said that.

00:01:31.680 --> 00:01:32.736
I actually brought a gift.

00:01:32.736 --> 00:01:37.196
So for my first show, Jennifer
Aniston, she's a friend.

00:01:37.196 --> 00:01:38.340
(laughing)

00:01:38.340 --> 00:01:39.890
- Drop.
- She,

00:01:39.890 --> 00:01:41.540
brought me a gift for my first show

00:01:41.540 --> 00:01:44.260
and it was good luck 'cause
I'm on for 17 seasons

00:01:44.260 --> 00:01:46.727
and I want the same for you.
- Okay 17 seasons?!

00:01:46.727 --> 00:01:49.660
(clapping)

00:01:49.660 --> 00:01:50.493
What?

00:01:52.000 --> 00:01:54.240
- So she brought me a welcome
mat and it was good luck

00:01:54.240 --> 00:01:56.210
and I wanted to bring you
something for your set

00:01:56.210 --> 00:01:58.576
so that you had good luck.
- Okay, I want it, what is it?

00:01:58.576 --> 00:02:00.054
What is it?
- Okay.

00:02:00.054 --> 00:02:00.887
- What is it?

00:02:00.887 --> 00:02:02.360
(crowd applauding)

00:02:02.360 --> 00:02:04.803
I got a gift from Ellen.

00:02:04.803 --> 00:02:07.053
(laughing)

00:02:19.168 --> 00:02:21.650
First of all, your childlike hands

00:02:21.650 --> 00:02:24.460
are my favorite, it's the best!

00:02:24.460 --> 00:02:26.019
- Those are my hands.
- They're childlike hands!

00:02:26.019 --> 00:02:26.950
- How dare you!

00:02:26.950 --> 00:02:28.180
(laughing)

00:02:28.180 --> 00:02:30.470
- This is, like, amazing.
- How dare you!

00:02:30.470 --> 00:02:32.070
- This is going in my office.

00:02:32.070 --> 00:02:33.090
- No, no, no!

00:02:33.090 --> 00:02:34.855
It's supposed to be on the set.

00:02:34.855 --> 00:02:36.450
- Okay, I'll do that.

00:02:36.450 --> 00:02:39.060
Don't you threaten me
with a good time, ma'am.

00:02:39.060 --> 00:02:41.360
All right, I'm gonna
find the perfect spot,

00:02:41.360 --> 00:02:44.030
maybe just like on the brick
wall, maybe we do that.

00:02:44.030 --> 00:02:44.863
- What're we all talking about?

00:02:44.863 --> 00:02:46.210
I wanna be a part of the conversation.

00:02:46.210 --> 00:02:48.540
- Okay, well, we were
talking about Instagrannies,

00:02:48.540 --> 00:02:49.460
have you ever heard of that?

00:02:49.460 --> 00:02:51.390
- I just recently did when I was backstage

00:02:51.390 --> 00:02:52.640
waiting to come back out.

00:02:52.640 --> 00:02:54.890
(laughing)

00:02:56.010 --> 00:02:58.430
- Well, wait, where's Baddie?

00:02:58.430 --> 00:02:59.263
There's Baddie!

00:02:59.263 --> 00:03:00.435
Hey, Baddie, what's up?

00:03:00.435 --> 00:03:03.960
(crowd applauding)

00:03:03.960 --> 00:03:06.700
So this is @baddiewinkle, y'all.

00:03:06.700 --> 00:03:10.297
She's from Kentucky and has
nearly four million viewers.

00:03:10.297 --> 00:03:13.339
(crowd applauding)

00:03:13.339 --> 00:03:15.760
Okay, wait, so Baddie,
your real name is Helen,

00:03:15.760 --> 00:03:18.540
so do you like to go by Helen or Baddie?

00:03:18.540 --> 00:03:20.610
- Well, I like to be called Baddie

00:03:20.610 --> 00:03:23.770
because everybody mostly knows me.

00:03:23.770 --> 00:03:24.603
- [Kelly] I love your accent.

00:03:24.603 --> 00:03:27.600
- By Baddie and I am a baddie bitch.

00:03:27.600 --> 00:03:29.850
(laughing)

00:03:37.188 --> 00:03:40.900
I'm also a rebel, always been a rebel.

00:03:40.900 --> 00:03:42.460
Always will be a rebel.

00:03:42.460 --> 00:03:45.386
- Yeah, you said, bitch
in daytime, you're good.

00:03:45.386 --> 00:03:47.011
(laughing)

00:03:47.011 --> 00:03:49.270
All right, so how did you
get started on Instagram?

00:03:49.270 --> 00:03:51.771
I'm curious 'cause my
mom's not on Instagram.

00:03:51.771 --> 00:03:55.290
- Okay, I took one little picture.

00:03:55.290 --> 00:03:58.200
So it went viral in a week.

00:03:58.200 --> 00:04:00.740
- Aw, that's cute, well, how
do you keep staying so young?

00:04:00.740 --> 00:04:02.960
Is it staying on Instagram,
is that your secret?

00:04:02.960 --> 00:04:07.010
- Well, I get on Instagram
almost every single day.

00:04:07.010 --> 00:04:08.520
It takes time.

00:04:08.520 --> 00:04:10.000
(laughing)

00:04:10.000 --> 00:04:11.830
- [Kelly] Do you have any
advice for other grannies

00:04:11.830 --> 00:04:14.370
out there wanting to nail it on Instagram?

00:04:14.370 --> 00:04:15.880
- [Baddie] The lighting and the angles

00:04:15.880 --> 00:04:17.430
is very important.
- Lighting is key.

00:04:17.430 --> 00:04:18.990
- I had to learn that.

00:04:18.990 --> 00:04:19.823
- [Kelly] Yes.

00:04:21.720 --> 00:04:25.190
- If they wanna be on
Instagram, just get on there,

00:04:25.190 --> 00:04:27.320
do your thing and be yourself.

00:04:27.320 --> 00:04:28.954
- Oh my God, I love you.

00:04:28.954 --> 00:04:31.787
All right, well thank you so much!

00:04:32.980 --> 00:04:36.380
- Before I go, I wanted to ask you,

00:04:36.380 --> 00:04:38.410
because I brought you a gift,

00:04:38.410 --> 00:04:39.890
if you had a gift for your audience,

00:04:39.890 --> 00:04:41.132
'cause they like gifts.

00:04:41.132 --> 00:04:43.450
- Well, I don't know if you heard, Ellen,

00:04:43.450 --> 00:04:46.156
but I did give a gift of song, so.

00:04:46.156 --> 00:04:48.906
(crowd cheering)

00:04:51.880 --> 00:04:54.980
We're a first season here, so
we have a little tiny budget.

00:04:54.980 --> 00:04:55.813
- Oh, you have a budget.

00:04:55.813 --> 00:04:56.646
Okay.
- A little one.

00:04:56.646 --> 00:04:58.760
- Well, I brought
something for the audience

00:04:58.760 --> 00:05:01.850
'cause I know, so.
(audience cheering)

00:05:01.850 --> 00:05:03.690
- Let's do this, let's do this!

00:05:03.690 --> 00:05:04.640
- I don't wanna stand here,

00:05:04.640 --> 00:05:05.750
can we bring an easel out or something?

00:05:05.750 --> 00:05:07.440
- Let's bring an easel, okay.

00:05:07.440 --> 00:05:08.670
Well, I can get an easel.

00:05:08.670 --> 00:05:09.680
- You have a budget for an easel?

00:05:09.680 --> 00:05:10.981
- I have a budget for an easel.

00:05:10.981 --> 00:05:11.814
(laughing)

00:05:11.814 --> 00:05:13.497
- All right, let's put this over there.

00:05:13.497 --> 00:05:14.715
- All right, let's put it, here we go.

00:05:14.715 --> 00:05:16.950
(soft music)

00:05:16.950 --> 00:05:19.780
All right, I just want
this to stay behind me

00:05:19.780 --> 00:05:22.603
the whole show, that would be amazing.

00:05:23.490 --> 00:05:24.960
- This stays there the whole season.

00:05:24.960 --> 00:05:28.530
- The whole, she said, I
said show, she said season!

00:05:28.530 --> 00:05:30.300
Seriously, do you have any advice for me?

00:05:30.300 --> 00:05:31.330
Come on.
- Look at how I said,

00:05:31.330 --> 00:05:32.433
have a seat.
- I know!

00:05:32.433 --> 00:05:33.630
(laughing)

00:05:33.630 --> 00:05:34.463
You're used to it.

00:05:34.463 --> 00:05:35.850
- Like it's my show.

00:05:35.850 --> 00:05:38.613
- And look how like I was like, yes ma'am.

00:05:38.613 --> 00:05:40.664
I was like, I'm used to that too, so.

00:05:40.664 --> 00:05:41.954
- So you're enjoying it?

00:05:41.954 --> 00:05:43.140
- I am, I am!
- Yeah?

00:05:43.140 --> 00:05:44.160
You're not bored with it yet?

00:05:44.160 --> 00:05:47.720
- No, no, but I love it.

00:05:47.720 --> 00:05:49.680
- It's a fun thing, 'cause
you have the proximity

00:05:49.680 --> 00:05:51.720
of the people right here,
and they get the energy

00:05:51.720 --> 00:05:53.710
and they get to see you so close up.

00:05:53.710 --> 00:05:55.200
- I know, I had to move 'em forward

00:05:55.200 --> 00:05:57.070
because even on tour I
don't like when the audience

00:05:57.070 --> 00:05:57.983
is so far, I like to play off of them.

00:05:57.983 --> 00:05:59.150
- Right, I agree.

00:05:59.150 --> 00:06:00.820
- You're probably like that,
you're a comedian obviously.

00:06:00.820 --> 00:06:03.460
- Yes, I like people close up,
but I like how lit they are,

00:06:03.460 --> 00:06:04.720
'cause they're part of the show.

00:06:04.720 --> 00:06:06.293
It's not like it's you and them.

00:06:06.293 --> 00:06:07.690
(audience applauding)

00:06:07.690 --> 00:06:08.800
Yeah, it's good.

00:06:08.800 --> 00:06:10.857
- We want everyone to look 20.

00:06:10.857 --> 00:06:11.960
(laughing)

00:06:11.960 --> 00:06:14.360
- So everyone's lit with
little things under them.

00:06:14.360 --> 00:06:15.377
- We have little Beyonce
lights for everyone.

00:06:15.377 --> 00:06:17.370
- [Ellen] That's so nice of you.

00:06:17.370 --> 00:06:18.990
- No, but obviously
you said you had a gift

00:06:18.990 --> 00:06:20.120
so I'm just gonna bring it up again

00:06:20.120 --> 00:06:21.167
'cause I'm excited for them.

00:06:21.167 --> 00:06:24.386
(audience laughing)

00:06:24.386 --> 00:06:26.927
I'm like, I'm so glad you're
here, where's the gifts?

00:06:26.927 --> 00:06:28.410
I'm just kidding.

00:06:28.410 --> 00:06:29.500
- No, people like gifts.
- They do.

00:06:29.500 --> 00:06:31.270
- You have a gift and now I wanted

00:06:31.270 --> 00:06:32.807
to give something to the audience.

00:06:32.807 --> 00:06:34.183
- That's very kind.

00:06:35.763 --> 00:06:38.240
- This is exciting, I
think you're gonna like it.

00:06:38.240 --> 00:06:40.171
Who likes kittens?

00:06:40.171 --> 00:06:41.670
(laughing)

00:06:41.670 --> 00:06:43.620
- I'm allergic but it's great.

00:06:43.620 --> 00:06:45.361
- All right, no, I'm just
curious, it was just a question.

00:06:45.361 --> 00:06:46.655
(laughing)

00:06:46.655 --> 00:06:47.733
It has nothing to do with the gift.

00:06:47.733 --> 00:06:49.320
- I just got terrified!

00:06:49.320 --> 00:06:50.420
- I just love kittens.

00:06:51.480 --> 00:06:55.430
All right, who likes plants?

00:06:55.430 --> 00:06:56.569
- I love plants.

00:06:56.569 --> 00:06:58.140
(audience cheering)

00:06:58.140 --> 00:06:59.100
I love gardening and trees.

00:06:59.100 --> 00:07:02.093
- Like ficus plants, like house plants?

00:07:03.000 --> 00:07:05.140
Ferns, ivy...
- Succulents!

00:07:05.140 --> 00:07:06.247
- Succulents are so easy to take care of.

00:07:06.247 --> 00:07:07.880
- [Kelly] You don't really have to.

00:07:07.880 --> 00:07:08.950
- Don't have to do anything.

00:07:08.950 --> 00:07:10.565
- It's a cold person's plant.

00:07:10.565 --> 00:07:11.398
(laughing)

00:07:11.398 --> 00:07:12.420
- It's someone who doesn't really

00:07:12.420 --> 00:07:14.810
have to have responsibility at all.

00:07:14.810 --> 00:07:16.593
All right, so.

00:07:18.352 --> 00:07:20.860
(crowd laughing)

00:07:20.860 --> 00:07:22.280
- No succulents either, no plants?

00:07:22.280 --> 00:07:24.330
- No plants, no.
- No plants, okay, okay.

00:07:24.330 --> 00:07:26.130
- No, I'm just playing
around, wasting time.

00:07:26.130 --> 00:07:27.390
- [Kelly] I love it, I love it.

00:07:27.390 --> 00:07:28.480
- And I can't.
- You can waste

00:07:28.480 --> 00:07:29.313
my time the whole show!

00:07:29.313 --> 00:07:30.146
- No, no, no, I can't.

00:07:30.146 --> 00:07:32.010
I have to actually get back to my show.

00:07:32.010 --> 00:07:34.360
I came over here to see
you to give you this

00:07:34.360 --> 00:07:36.440
but I have to now do my show as well.

00:07:36.440 --> 00:07:40.060
But so the gift is, you all
know that for I don't know,

00:07:40.060 --> 00:07:43.490
like five years now, maybe
more, we've been in business

00:07:43.490 --> 00:07:46.280
with TCL Roku and they have the best TVs

00:07:46.280 --> 00:07:51.038
and so everyone here needs to
have a 65-inch TCL Roku TV.

00:07:51.038 --> 00:07:53.788
(crowd cheering)

00:08:02.395 --> 00:08:03.228
- That's so good!

00:08:03.228 --> 00:08:04.698
- You should show 'em
what the box looks like.

00:08:04.698 --> 00:08:09.540
- Okay, so this is actually great.

00:08:09.540 --> 00:08:12.603
Ellen pointed out that we
really wanted y'all to know

00:08:12.603 --> 00:08:15.003
what the box looks like
that it came in as well.

00:08:16.050 --> 00:08:17.330
I don't know why we didn't just bring out

00:08:17.330 --> 00:08:19.669
the really fancy nice TVs.

00:08:19.669 --> 00:08:20.745
- It's important to see
what the box looks like.

00:08:20.745 --> 00:08:23.404
- And this is what it's gonna
look like on your doorstep.

00:08:23.404 --> 00:08:25.782
(audience cheering)

00:08:25.782 --> 00:08:26.983
Thank you so much!

00:08:26.983 --> 00:08:28.339
- Have fun!
- Thank you!

00:08:28.339 --> 00:08:29.739
- Kelly Clarkson, everybody!

